ud3.10:9.1 starts: For the monk unbound
ud3.10:9.2 starts: through lack of clinging/sustenance,
ud3.10:9.3 starts: He has conquered Māra,
ud3.10:9.4 starts: having gone beyond becomings
ud4.1:24.1 starts: But comprehending the thoughts of the heart,
ud4.1:24.2 starts: one who is ardent, mindful,
ud4.1:24.3 starts: When, followed, they stir up the heart,
ud4.1:24.4 starts: lets them go without trace.
ud4.3:8.1 starts: Whatever an enemy
ud4.3:8.2 starts: or a foe
ud4.3:8.3 starts: the ill-directed mind
ud4.3:8.4 starts: can do to you
ud4.4:10.1 starts: Whose mind, standing like rock,
ud4.4:10.2 starts: doesn’t shake,
ud4.4:10.3 starts: dispassionate for things that spark passion,
ud4.4:10.4 starts: unprovoked by things that spark provocation:
ud4.4:10.5 starts: When one’s mind is developed like this,
ud4.4:10.6 starts: from where can there come to him
ud4.5:8.1 starts: This
ud4.5:8.2 starts: the great one’s with the great one’s–
ud4.5:8.3 starts: the elephant with tusks like chariot poles:
ud4.5:8.4 starts: that each finds joy,
ud4.8:12.1 starts: “He goes to hell,
ud4.8:12.2 starts: as does the one
ud4.8:12.3 starts: Both–low-acting people–
ud4.8:12.4 starts: after death, in the world beyond.”
ud4.8:14.1 starts: “He goes to hell,
ud4.8:14.2 starts: as does the one
ud4.8:14.3 starts: Both–low-acting people–
ud4.8:14.4 starts: after death, in the world beyond.”
ud5.3:13.1 starts: As one with eyes & having energy
ud5.3:13.2 starts: would
ud5.3:13.3 starts: so a wise one, in the world of life,
ud5.3:13.4 starts: should
ud5.4:5.1 starts: If you’re doing or will do
ud5.4:5.2 starts: an evil deed,
ud5.4:5.3 starts: you won’t escape pain
ud5.4:5.4 starts: catching up
